# forgejo-mcp — Cursor rules (see AGENTS.md, session_context_injection.md)

Use `uv run python -m forgejo_mcp` to start; ports 11132 (web) / 11133 (API).
Never point this server at GitHub.com (that is git-github-mcp).

## Session Context (forgejo-mcp)

Before starting work: call `forgejo_status` (health + active profile) and
`forgejo_profile_list` (instances). Pass `profile` explicitly off-active.
Prefer read-only checks (`forgejo_repo_search`, `forgejo_pr_diff`) before
create/merge/comment. Ports are 11132/11133, never 10760/10761.
At end of work: commit on a clean tree; never commit PATs or `.env.profiles.json`.
